        "accession_number": "0001609550-26-000016",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Similarly, we are subject to regulations and product registration requirements in many foreign countries in which we may sell our products, including in the areas of:",
